OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin mosaic of national
OL,4,Atreasure set to be unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA giant pumpkin portrait of a mystery
OL,7,Fcelebrity is set to be unveiled after
OL,8,Fweeks of planning and construction.
OL,10,FThe attraction at Sunnyfields Farm in
OL,11,FTotton, Hampshire, has used more than
OL,12,F10,000 pumpkins to create its annual
OL,13,Fmosaic artwork.
OL,15,FLast year's portrait, which featured
OL,16,Fthe late Ozzy Osbourne, broke the
OL,17,FGuinness World Record for largest
OL,18,Fcucurbita mosaic at 212 m sq (2,281 sq
OL,19,Fft).
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
