OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin mosaic of national
OL,4,Atreasure set to be unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FSunnyfields' bosses hope to break the
OL,7,Frecord again in 2026, and the identity
OL,8,Fof this year's mystery subject will be
OL,9,Frevealed during a livestream on the BBC
OL,10,FNews website on Tuesday at 18:00 BST.
